    "e334c375-23dc-4341-903b-e14794e57f42": {
      "id": "e334c375-23dc-4341-903b-e14794e57f42",
      "text": "Procurement case PR-2026-0417 for ₹1,40,000 worth of bearing housings from vendor V-017 was blocked due to an expired ISO 9001 certificate. | When: 2026-03-14 | Involving: R. Menon (Procurement Ops), V-017 (vendor) | The standard vendor check blocks vendors with expired certifications, but V-017 had a 2-year history of on-time delivery and was in the process of renewing.",
      "type": "world",
      "context": "procurement exception resolution",
      "occurred_start": "2026-03-14T06:30:00+00:00",
      "occurred_end": "2026-03-14T06:30:00+00:00",
